<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xs:schema xmlns:xs="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
           xmlns="https://studentcouncil.eu-varna.bg/schemas/api/v1"
           targetNamespace="https://studentcouncil.eu-varna.bg/schemas/api/v1"
           elementFormDefault="qualified"
           attributeFormDefault="unqualified"
           version="1.0">

  <xs:annotation>
    <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg"><![CDATA[
      XSD схема на ВСИЧКИ входящи заявки към Student Council API (версия v1).

      Базов път на всички ендпойнти: /api/v1/...

      КОНВЕНЦИИ
      ---------
      * Имената на елементите съвпадат едно към едно с имената на полетата по мрежата.
        API-то сериализира с System.Text.Json и подразбиращата се camelCase политика
        (Program.cs регистрира само JsonStringEnumConverter), затова всички полета тук
        са в camelCase.
      * Изброимите типове (enum) се предават като СТРИНГОВЕ, а не като числа
        (JsonStringEnumConverter). Стойностите са чувствителни към регистъра при тяло
        на заявка (body) и НЕчувствителни при query филтри (Enum.TryParse с ignoreCase).
      * DateTime полетата са в UTC (xs:dateTime). DateOnly полетата са дати без час
        (xs:date).
      * Guid полетата са в каноничен 8-4-4-4-12 формат.
      * Всеки тип носи в документацията си HTTP метода, маршрута и източника на всяко
        поле: (path) = параметър в маршрута, (query) = query string, (body) = JSON тяло,
        (multipart) = поле от multipart/form-data.
      * Заявки без никакви параметри също са описани (с празен тип), за да е схемата
        пълно покритие на API-то.

      ОБХВАТ И ТОЧНОСТ
      ----------------
      * Ограниченията (дължини, диапазони, регулярни изрази) са пренесени от
        FluentValidation валидаторите, от EF Core конфигурацията на модела и от
        клампването в handler-ите.
      * Схемата е на места по-СТРОГА от сървъра там, където сървърът мълчаливо
        игнорира невалидна стойност вместо да върне 400 — това е отбелязано изрично
        при съответния тип (виж напр. филтрите по enum и Month).
      * Ограничения, които зависят от състоянието на базата (напр. „департаментът
        трябва да съществува“, „изпълнителите трябва да са активни членове“) не могат
        да се изразят в XSD и са описани само в документацията.
      * Авторизацията (JWT bearer токен, роли и policy-та) не е част от тялото на
        заявката и не е моделирана тук.
    ]]></xs:documentation>
  </xs:annotation>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 1. ОБЩИ ПРОСТИ ТИПОВЕ                                                -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:simpleType name="Guid">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        UUID в каноничен вид, напр. 3f2504e0-4f89-11d3-9a0c-0305e82c3301.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:pattern value="[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="Email">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Имейл адрес. Съответства на FluentValidation .EmailAddress() в
        AspNetCoreCompatible режим: точно едно „@“, което не е нито първи, нито
        последен символ. Горната граница 256 идва от ASP.NET Core Identity.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:minLength value="3"/>
      <xs:maxLength value="256"/>
      <xs:pattern value="[^@]+@[^@]+"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="PasswordMinLength">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Междинна стъпка от деривацията на Password — само минималната дължина.
        Не се използва пряко в заявки.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:minLength value="8"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="PasswordWithUpperCase">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Междинна стъпка от деривацията на Password — изисква главна буква.
        Не се използва пряко в заявки.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="PasswordMinLength">
      <xs:pattern value=".*[A-Z].*"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="Password">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Нова парола (PasswordRules.Password, спец. 6.4): минимум 8 символа, поне една
        главна буква и поне една цифра. Трите ограничения са наложени чрез верига от
        деривации, защото фасетите pattern в една стъпка се комбинират с ИЛИ, а през
        отделни стъпки — с И. Забележка: „.“ в XSD regex не съвпада с нов ред, тоест
        пароли, съдържащи нов ред, не се валидират коректно от тази схема (сървърът
        ги приема).
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="PasswordWithUpperCase">
      <xs:pattern value=".*[0-9].*"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="NonEmptyString">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Задължителен стринг без ограничение по горна дължина (FluentValidation
        .NotEmpty()). Само празен низ не се допуска.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:minLength value="1"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="PhoneNumber">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Телефонен номер. Валидира се само при непразна стойност:
        maxLength 30 и шаблон ^\+?[0-9\s\-]{6,20}$ (UpdateMyProfileValidator).
        Забележка: полето се валидира само в PUT /members/me; в POST /members и
        PUT /members/{id} сървърът не налага формат — виж MemberPhoneNumber.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:maxLength value="30"/>
      <xs:pattern value="\+?[0-9\s\-]{6,20}"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="MemberPhoneNumber">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Телефон при административно създаване/редакция на член. За това поле няма
        FluentValidation правило — сървърът приема произволен стринг. Горната граница
        е тази на Identity колоната PhoneNumber.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:maxLength value="256"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="FullName">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">Име на член: 2–120 символа.</xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:minLength value="2"/>
      <xs:maxLength value="120"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="Title">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Заглавие на задача или събитие: 3–150 символа.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:minLength value="3"/>
      <xs:maxLength value="150"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="Description">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Свободно описание на задача или събитие: до 4000 символа.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:maxLength value="4000"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="Location">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">Място на събитие: до 300 символа.</xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:maxLength value="300"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="DutyNote">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">Бележка към дежурство: до 1000 символа.</xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:maxLength value="1000"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="CommentText">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">Текст на коментар: 1–2000 символа.</xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:minLength value="1"/>
      <xs:maxLength value="2000"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="ExpenseDescription">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">Описание на разход: 1–300 символа.</xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:minLength value="1"/>
      <xs:maxLength value="300"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="AmountEur">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Сума в евро: строго положителна, най-много 2 знака след десетичната запетая.
        Общата точност (10, 2) идва от ExpenseConfiguration.HasPrecision.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:decimal">
      <xs:minExclusive value="0"/>
      <xs:totalDigits value="10"/>
      <xs:fractionDigits value="2"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="DeviceToken">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">FCM/APNs push токен: 1–512 символа.</xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:minLength value="1"/>
      <xs:maxLength value="512"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="SearchTerm">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Търсене по име или имейл (частично съвпадение, без значение за регистъра).
        Стойност само от интервали се игнорира.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string"/>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="PageNumber">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Номер на страница, започвайки от 1. По подразбиране 1. Стойност &lt; 1 не води
        до грешка — сървърът я нормализира до 1.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:int">
      <xs:minInclusive value="1"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="PageSize">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Брой записи на страница. По подразбиране 20, максимум 100. Сървърът клампва
        стойността в интервала [1, 100] вместо да връща грешка.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:int">
      <xs:minInclusive value="1"/>
      <xs:maxInclusive value="100"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="Year">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Календарна година за филтриране. Сървърът не валидира диапазон — стойност
        извън смисления обхват просто връща празен резултат.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:int">
      <xs:minInclusive value="1"/>
      <xs:maxInclusive value="9999"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="Month">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Месец 1–12. Сървърът НЕ валидира диапазона; стойност извън 1–12 не води до
        400, а до празен резултат. Схемата тук е умишлено по-строга.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:int">
      <xs:minInclusive value="1"/>
      <xs:maxInclusive value="12"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="FileName">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Оригинално име на качен файл: до 260 символа (TaskDocumentConfiguration).
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:minLength value="1"/>
      <xs:maxLength value="260"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 2. ИЗБРОИМИ ТИПОВЕ (StudentCouncil.Domain.Enums)                     -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:simpleType name="SystemRole">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Роля в системата — единственият източник на истина за авторизацията.
        Org-ролите (OrgSecretary, OrgVicePresident, OrgPresident) НЕ могат да имат
        департамент; всички останали задължително имат.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="Member"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="DeptSecretary"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="DeptVicePresident"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="DeptPresident"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="OrgSecretary"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="OrgVicePresident"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="OrgPresident"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="DepartmentCode">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">Код на департамент (използва се при филтрирането).</xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="PR"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Projects"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Social"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Sports"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="MemberStatus">
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="Active"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Inactive"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="TaskScope">
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="Organizational"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Departmental"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="TaskPriority">
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="Low"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Medium"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="High"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Critical"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="TaskStatus">
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="New"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="InProgress"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="InReview"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Completed"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Cancelled"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="EventType">
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="Meeting"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="PublicEvent"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="InternalMeeting"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="SportsEvent"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Deadline"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Other"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="RecurrenceType">
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="None"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Weekly"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="Monthly"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="DevicePlatform">
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="Android"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="iOS"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="CalendarView">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Предефиниран календарен прозорец, използван когато from/to липсват:
        day = текущият ден, week = текущата седмица (от понеделник),
        month = текущият месец, list = 90 дни напред от „сега“.
        Всяка неразпозната стойност се третира като „list“ (сървърът не връща грешка).
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="day"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="week"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="month"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="list"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="TaskSort">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Сортиране на задачи. Префиксът „-“ обръща посоката. Разпознати полета
        (без значение за регистъра): dueAt, priority, status, title. При липсваща или
        неразпозната стойност се сортира по createdAt низходящо, а „-“ пред
        неразпозната стойност дава createdAt възходящо.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:pattern value="-?([dD][uU][eE][aA][tT]|[pP][rR][iI][oO][rR][iI][tT][yY]|[sS][tT][aA][tT][uU][sS]|[tT][iI][tT][lL][eE]|[cC][rR][eE][aA][tT][eE][dD][aA][tT])"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="MemberSort">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Сортиране на членове. Префиксът „-“ обръща посоката. Разпознати полета
        (без значение за регистъра): joinedOn, role. При липсваща или неразпозната
        стойност се сортира по fullName.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:pattern value="-?([jJ][oO][iI][nN][eE][dD][oO][nN]|[rR][oO][lL][eE]|[fF][uU][lL][lL][nN][aA][mM][eE])"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="DocumentContentType">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        MIME типове, приемани за документ към задача (AllowedFileTypes.Documents).
        Сървърът проверява и разширението, и „магическите байтове“ на файла — самото
        деклариране на позволен MIME тип не е достатъчно.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="application/pdf"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="application/msword"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="text/plain"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="application/vnd.ms-excel"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="text/csv"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="application/csv"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="application/vnd.ms-powerpoint"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="image/jpeg"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="image/png"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="image/gif"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="image/heic"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="image/heif"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <xs:simpleType name="ImageContentType">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        MIME типове, приемани за профилна снимка (AllowedFileTypes.Images):
        .jpg/.jpeg, .png, .heic.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="image/jpeg"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="image/png"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="image/heic"/>
      <xs:enumeration value="image/heif"/>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 3. ОБЩИ СЪСТАВНИ ТИПОВЕ                                              -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:complexType name="GuidList">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Списък от идентификатори (в JSON — масив от стрингове). Може да е празен.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="id" type="Guid" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"/>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="NonEmptyGuidList">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Списък от идентификатори с поне един елемент.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="id" type="Guid" maxOccurs="unbounded"/>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="EmptyRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Заявка без тяло и без параметри — носи само Authorization хедъра.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence/>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="IdRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Заявка, чийто единствен вход е идентификатор в маршрута.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="id" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на ресурса.</xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="FileUpload">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Съдържание на качван файл. По мрежата това е част от multipart/form-data с
        име на полето „file“; тук съдържанието е представено като base64, а името и
        MIME типът — като атрибути, за да е описуемо в XSD.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:simpleContent>
      <xs:extension base="xs:base64Binary">
        <xs:attribute name="fileName" type="FileName" use="required"/>
        <xs:attribute name="contentType" type="xs:string" use="required"/>
      </xs:extension>
    </xs:simpleContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 4. АУТЕНТИКАЦИЯ — /api/v1/auth                                       -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:complexType name="LoginRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/auth/login — анонимен достъп, rate limit политика „auth“.
        Връща двойка access + refresh токен.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="email" type="Email">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Имейл за вход.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="password" type="NonEmptyString">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
            (body) Парола. При вход се изисква само да е непразна — сложността се
            проверява при задаване, не при вход.
          </xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="RefreshRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/auth/refresh — анонимен достъп. Ротира двойката токени.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="refreshToken" type="NonEmptyString">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Издаденият refresh токен.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="LogoutRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/auth/logout — изисква автентикация, минава покрай гейта за
        задължителна смяна на парола. Идемпотентно анулира подадения refresh токен.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="refreshToken" type="NonEmptyString">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Refresh токенът за анулиране.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="ChangePasswordRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/auth/change-password — изисква автентикация, минава покрай гейта
        за задължителна смяна на парола. Изчиства флага mustChangePassword.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="currentPassword" type="NonEmptyString">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Текущата парола.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="newPassword" type="Password">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Новата парола (виж Password).</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="ForgotPasswordRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password — анонимен достъп. Винаги връща 200,
        независимо дали акаунтът съществува (без изброяване на потребители).
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="email" type="Email">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Имейл на акаунта.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="ResetPasswordRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password — анонимен достъп. Задава нова парола срещу
        токен, изпратен по имейл.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="email" type="Email">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Имейл на акаунта.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="token" type="NonEmptyString">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Токенът за нулиране от имейла.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="newPassword" type="Password">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Новата парола (виж Password).</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetMeRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/auth/me — без параметри. Връща профил, роля, департамент и
        правата на текущия потребител.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="EmptyRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:element name="loginRequest" type="LoginRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="refreshRequest" type="RefreshRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="logoutRequest" type="LogoutRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="changePasswordRequest" type="ChangePasswordRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="forgotPasswordRequest" type="ForgotPasswordRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="resetPasswordRequest" type="ResetPasswordRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getMeRequest" type="GetMeRequest"/>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 5. ЧЛЕНОВЕ — /api/v1/members                                         -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:complexType name="GetMembersRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/members — страницирана и филтрируема справка за членовете.
        Всички параметри са опционални и идват от query string.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="department" type="DepartmentCode" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
            (query) Филтър по код на департамент. Неразпозната стойност се игнорира
            мълчаливо (без 400).
          </xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="role" type="SystemRole" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Филтър по роля. Неразпозната стойност се игнорира.</xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="status" type="MemberStatus" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
            (query) Филтър по статус. По подразбиране и при неразпозната стойност
            се връщат само активните членове.
          </xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="search" type="SearchTerm" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Търсене по име или имейл.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="sort" type="MemberSort" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Сортиране (виж MemberSort).</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="page" type="PageNumber" minOccurs="0" default="1">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Страница; по подразбиране 1.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="pageSize" type="PageSize" minOccurs="0" default="20">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Размер на страницата; по подразбиране 20, максимум 100.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetMyProfileRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">GET /api/v1/members/me — без параметри.</xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="EmptyRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="UpdateMyProfileRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        PUT /api/v1/members/me — самообслужване: единственото поле, което членът може
        да променя сам, е телефонният номер.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="phoneNumber" type="PhoneNumber" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
            (body) Нов телефон; null или липсващо поле изчиства стойността.
          </xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="UpdateMyPhotoRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        PUT /api/v1/members/me/photo — multipart/form-data с поле „file“.
        Приемат се само изображения (виж ImageContentType), максимум 5 MB.
        Типът се проверява и по разширение, и по сигнатурата на файла.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="file" type="FileUpload">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(multipart) Файлът със снимката.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetMemberPhotoRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/members/{id}/photo — връща аватара като поток от байтове.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="id" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на члена.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetMemberRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">GET /api/v1/members/{id} — пълен профил на член.</xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="CreateMemberRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/members — policy „CanManageMembers“. Създава акаунт и изпраща
        временна парола по имейл.

        Правила, които XSD не може да изрази:
        * имейлът трябва да е уникален;
        * Org ролите НЕ трябва да имат departmentId, всички останали роли — трябва;
        * подаденият departmentId трябва да съществува.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="fullName" type="FullName">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Име и фамилия, 2–120 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="email" type="Email">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Уникален имейл за вход.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="phoneNumber" type="MemberPhoneNumber" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Телефон, по избор.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="role" type="SystemRole">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Роля в системата.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="departmentId" type="Guid" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
            (body) Департамент. Задължителен за всички роли освен Org ролите; за Org
            ролите трябва да липсва.
          </xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="joinedOn" type="xs:date">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Дата на присъединяване.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="UpdateMemberRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        PUT /api/v1/members/{id} — policy „CanManageMembers“. Същите правила за
        съответствие роля ↔ департамент като при създаване. Имейлът не се променя
        през този ендпойнт.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="id" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на члена.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="fullName" type="FullName">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Име и фамилия, 2–120 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="phoneNumber" type="MemberPhoneNumber" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Телефон, по избор.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="role" type="SystemRole">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Роля в системата.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="departmentId" type="Guid" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Департамент (виж правилата в CreateMemberRequest).</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="joinedOn" type="xs:date">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Дата на присъединяване.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="DeactivateMemberRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/members/{id}/deactivate — policy „CanManageMembers“. Без тяло.
        Анулира токените и ротира security stamp-а на члена.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="ReactivateMemberRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/members/{id}/reactivate — policy „CanManageMembers“. Без тяло.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:element name="getMembersRequest" type="GetMembersRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getMyProfileRequest" type="GetMyProfileRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="updateMyProfileRequest" type="UpdateMyProfileRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="updateMyPhotoRequest" type="UpdateMyPhotoRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getMemberPhotoRequest" type="GetMemberPhotoRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getMemberRequest" type="GetMemberRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="createMemberRequest" type="CreateMemberRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="updateMemberRequest" type="UpdateMemberRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="deactivateMemberRequest" type="DeactivateMemberRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="reactivateMemberRequest" type="ReactivateMemberRequest"/>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 6. ДЕПАРТАМЕНТИ — /api/v1/departments                                -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:complexType name="GetDepartmentsRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/departments — без параметри. Всички департаменти с брой членове
        и ръководство.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="EmptyRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetDepartmentRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/departments/{id} — детайли за департамент заедно с членовете му.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:element name="getDepartmentsRequest" type="GetDepartmentsRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getDepartmentRequest" type="GetDepartmentRequest"/>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 7. ЗАДАЧИ — /api/v1/tasks                                            -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:complexType name="GetTasksRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/tasks — страницирана справка, ограничена до задачите, видими за
        текущия потребител. Всички параметри са опционални и идват от query string;
        неразпознатите enum стойности се игнорират мълчаливо.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="scope" type="TaskScope" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Организационни или департаментни задачи.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="department" type="DepartmentCode" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Филтър по код на департамент.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="assignee" type="Guid" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Само задачи с този изпълнител.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="priority" type="TaskPriority" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Филтър по приоритет.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="status" type="TaskStatus" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Филтър по статус.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="from" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Долна граница на крайния срок (UTC, включително).</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="to" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Горна граница на крайния срок (UTC, включително).</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="overdue" type="xs:boolean" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
            (query) При true се връщат само просрочените задачи (с изтекъл срок и
            статус, различен от Completed и Cancelled). false няма ефект.
          </xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="sort" type="TaskSort" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Сортиране (виж TaskSort).</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="page" type="PageNumber" minOccurs="0" default="1">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Страница; по подразбиране 1.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="pageSize" type="PageSize" minOccurs="0" default="20">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Размер на страницата; по подразбиране 20, максимум 100.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetMyTasksRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/tasks/mine — без параметри. Задачите, на които текущият
        потребител е изпълнител.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="EmptyRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetTaskBoardRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/tasks/board — без параметри. Kanban изглед на видимите задачи,
        групирани по статус (отменените се пропускат).
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="EmptyRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetTaskRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/tasks/{id} — пълни детайли. Връща 404 и когато задачата
        съществува, но не е видима за потребителя.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="CreateTaskRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/tasks — policy „CanCreateDeptTask“, плюс проверка на обхвата в
        handler-а.

        Правила, които XSD не може да изрази:
        * scope = Departmental изисква departmentId; scope = Organizational забранява го;
        * подаденият departmentId трябва да съществува;
        * всеки изпълнител трябва да е съществуващ и активен член;
        * dueAtUtc, ако е подаден, трябва да е в бъдещето.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="title" type="Title">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Заглавие, 3–150 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="description" type="Description" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Описание, до 4000 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="priority" type="TaskPriority">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Приоритет.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="scope" type="TaskScope">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Обхват на задачата.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="departmentId" type="Guid" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Департамент — само при scope = Departmental.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="dueAtUtc" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Краен срок в UTC; трябва да е в бъдещето.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="assigneeIds" type="NonEmptyGuidList">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Поне един изпълнител.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="UpdateTaskRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        PUT /api/v1/tasks/{id} — policy „CanCreateDeptTask“. Обхватът и департаментът
        на задачата не се променят през този ендпойнт. Проверката „срокът е в
        бъдещето“ не се прилага при редакция.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="id" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на задачата.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="title" type="Title">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Заглавие, 3–150 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="description" type="Description" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Описание, до 4000 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="priority" type="TaskPriority">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Приоритет.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="dueAtUtc" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Краен срок в UTC.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="assigneeIds" type="NonEmptyGuidList">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Пълен нов списък с изпълнители; поне един.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="ChangeTaskStatusRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        PATCH /api/v1/tasks/{id}/status — разрешените преходи зависят от това дали
        потребителят е изпълнител или ръководство; проверката е в handler-а.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="id" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на задачата.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="status" type="TaskStatus">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Новият статус.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="CancelTaskRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/tasks/{id}/cancel — без тяло. Идемпотентно: повторно отменяне на
        вече отменена задача не променя нищо.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="DeleteTaskRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        DELETE /api/v1/tasks/{id} — policy „OrgPresidentOnly“. Физическо изтриване
        заедно с прикачените документи.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetTaskCommentsRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/tasks/{id}/comments — хронологичен списък на коментарите.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="AddTaskCommentRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">POST /api/v1/tasks/{id}/comments — добавя коментар.</xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="id" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на задачата.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="text" type="CommentText">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Текст на коментара, 1–2000 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:element name="getTasksRequest" type="GetTasksRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getMyTasksRequest" type="GetMyTasksRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getTaskBoardRequest" type="GetTaskBoardRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getTaskRequest" type="GetTaskRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="createTaskRequest" type="CreateTaskRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="updateTaskRequest" type="UpdateTaskRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="changeTaskStatusRequest" type="ChangeTaskStatusRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="cancelTaskRequest" type="CancelTaskRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="deleteTaskRequest" type="DeleteTaskRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getTaskCommentsRequest" type="GetTaskCommentsRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="addTaskCommentRequest" type="AddTaskCommentRequest"/>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 8. ДОКУМЕНТИ КЪМ ЗАДАЧА — /api/v1/tasks/{taskId}/documents           -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:complexType name="GetTaskDocumentsRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/tasks/{taskId}/documents — метаданни на документите (без вътрешните
        ключове за съхранение).
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="taskId" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на задачата.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="UploadTaskDocumentRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/tasks/{taskId}/documents — multipart/form-data с поле „file“.
        Максимум 25 MB. Форматът се проверява по разширение, деклариран MIME тип и
        сигнатура („магически байтове“) — виж DocumentContentType.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="taskId" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на задачата.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="file" type="FileUpload">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(multipart) Файлът за качване.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="DownloadTaskDocumentRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/tasks/{taskId}/documents/{docId}/download — връща файла като
        прикачен файл.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="taskId" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на задачата.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="docId" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на документа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="DeleteTaskDocumentRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        DELETE /api/v1/tasks/{taskId}/documents/{docId} — разрешено на качилия файла
        или на организационното ръководство.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="taskId" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на задачата.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="docId" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на документа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:element name="getTaskDocumentsRequest" type="GetTaskDocumentsRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="uploadTaskDocumentRequest" type="UploadTaskDocumentRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="downloadTaskDocumentRequest" type="DownloadTaskDocumentRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="deleteTaskDocumentRequest" type="DeleteTaskDocumentRequest"/>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 9. КАЛЕНДАР И СЪБИТИЯ — /api/v1/events                               -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:complexType name="GetEventsRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/events — записи в календарен прозорец: реални събития (с
        разгънати повторения) плюс крайните срокове на задачите. Ако from/to липсват,
        прозорецът се определя от view.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="from" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Начало на прозореца в UTC.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="to" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Край на прозореца в UTC.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="type" type="EventType" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Филтър по вид събитие.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="department" type="DepartmentCode" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Филтър по департамент.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="view" type="CalendarView" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Подразбиращ се прозорец, когато from/to липсват.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="ExportEventsIcsRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/events/export.ics — същият прозорец и същите филтри като
        GET /api/v1/events, но резултатът е файл text/calendar.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="GetEventsRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetEventRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/events/{id} — пълни детайли, включително участниците.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="CreateEventRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/events — policy „CanManageEvents“. Организаторът се определя от
        сървъра (текущият потребител). Отговорът включва евентуални застъпвания
        в графика като предупреждение, но те не блокират създаването.

        Правила, които XSD не може да изрази:
        * endUtc трябва да е строго след startUtc;
        * подаденият departmentId трябва да съществува;
        * всеки участник трябва да е съществуващ и активен член.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="title" type="Title">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Заглавие, 3–150 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="description" type="Description" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Описание, до 4000 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="startUtc" type="xs:dateTime">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Начало в UTC.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="endUtc" type="xs:dateTime">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Край в UTC; строго след началото.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="location" type="Location" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Място, до 300 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="type" type="EventType">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Вид на събитието.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="departmentId" type="Guid" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Департамент; липсва при общоорганизационни събития.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="recurrence" type="RecurrenceType">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Повторяемост.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="participantIds" type="GuidList" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
            (body) Участници; може да липсва или да е празен списък. Дублираните
            идентификатори се премахват от сървъра.
          </xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="UpdateEventRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        PUT /api/v1/events/{id} — policy „CanManageEvents“ плюс проверка EventAccess
        (организатор, ръководство на собствения департамент или организационно
        ръководство). Същите правила за валидация като при създаване.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="id" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на събитието.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="title" type="Title">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Заглавие, 3–150 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="description" type="Description" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Описание, до 4000 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="startUtc" type="xs:dateTime">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Начало в UTC.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="endUtc" type="xs:dateTime">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Край в UTC; строго след началото.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="location" type="Location" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Място, до 300 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="type" type="EventType">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Вид на събитието.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="departmentId" type="Guid" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Департамент.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="recurrence" type="RecurrenceType">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Повторяемост.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="participantIds" type="GuidList" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Пълен нов списък с участници.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="DeleteEventRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        DELETE /api/v1/events/{id} — policy „CanManageEvents“; секретарите нямат право
        да изтриват.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:element name="getEventsRequest" type="GetEventsRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="exportEventsIcsRequest" type="ExportEventsIcsRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getEventRequest" type="GetEventRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="createEventRequest" type="CreateEventRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="updateEventRequest" type="UpdateEventRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="deleteEventRequest" type="DeleteEventRequest"/>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 10. ДЕЖУРСТВА — /api/v1/duty-records                                 -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:complexType name="GetDutyRecordsRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/duty-records — обикновен член вижда само собствените си
        дежурства (подаденият memberId се игнорира); ръководството на дежурствата
        вижда всички и може да филтрира.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="memberId" type="Guid" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Филтър по член; уважава се само за ръководството.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="year" type="Year" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Отчетна година.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="month" type="Month" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Отчетен месец (1–12).</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetDutySummaryRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/duty-records/summary — policy „CanManageDuties“. Месечна таблица
        с нормата за всички активни членове. При липсващи параметри се използва
        текущият месец.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="year" type="Year" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Година; по подразбиране текущата.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="month" type="Month" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Месец; по подразбиране текущият.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetMyDutySummaryRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/duty-records/me/summary — месечният статус на текущия потребител
        спрямо нормата.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="GetDutySummaryRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="CreateDutyRecordRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/duty-records — policy „CanManageDuties“. Продължителността и
        отчетният период се изчисляват на сървъра от startUtc/endUtc и никога не се
        приемат от клиента.

        Правила, които XSD не може да изрази:
        * endUtc трябва да е след startUtc и дежурството да е поне 1 минута;
        * memberId трябва да е съществуващ и активен член.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="memberId" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Членът, който е дежурил.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="startUtc" type="xs:dateTime">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Начало на смяната в UTC.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="endUtc" type="xs:dateTime">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Край на смяната в UTC.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="note" type="DutyNote" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Бележка, до 1000 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="UpdateDutyRecordRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        PUT /api/v1/duty-records/{id} — policy „CanManageDuties“. Членът не се
        променя през този ендпойнт; продължителността и периодът се преизчисляват.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="id" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на записа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="startUtc" type="xs:dateTime">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Начало на смяната в UTC.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="endUtc" type="xs:dateTime">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Край на смяната в UTC.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="note" type="DutyNote" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Бележка, до 1000 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="DeleteDutyRecordRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        DELETE /api/v1/duty-records/{id} — policy „CanManageDuties“.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="RemindDutiesRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/duty-records/remind — policy „CanManageDuties“. Тялото е
        незадължително: без memberId напомняне се изпраща до всички под нормата.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="memberId" type="Guid" minOccurs="0" nillable="true">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
            (body) Конкретен член. При липса — всички членове под месечната норма.
          </xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:element name="getDutyRecordsRequest" type="GetDutyRecordsRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getDutySummaryRequest" type="GetDutySummaryRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getMyDutySummaryRequest" type="GetMyDutySummaryRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="createDutyRecordRequest" type="CreateDutyRecordRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="updateDutyRecordRequest" type="UpdateDutyRecordRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="deleteDutyRecordRequest" type="DeleteDutyRecordRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="remindDutiesRequest" type="RemindDutiesRequest"/>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 11. БЮДЖЕТ — /api/v1/budget                                          -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:complexType name="GetBudgetSummaryRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/budget/summary — общо изразходвана сума за година. Достъпно за
        всички автентикирани потребители.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="year" type="Year" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Година; по подразбиране текущата.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="GetExpensesRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/budget/expenses — страницирана хронологична справка за разходите.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="year" type="Year" minOccurs="0">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Филтър по година.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="page" type="PageNumber" minOccurs="0" default="1">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Страница; по подразбиране 1.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="pageSize" type="PageSize" minOccurs="0" default="20">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Размер на страницата; по подразбиране 20, максимум 100.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="CreateExpenseRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/budget/expenses — policy „CanManageBudget“. Отчетната година се
        извежда от датата на разхода и не се подава от клиента.

        Правило, което XSD не изразява: spentOn не може да е в бъдещето.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="description" type="ExpenseDescription">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Описание, 1–300 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="amountEur" type="AmountEur">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Сума в евро, &gt; 0, най-много 2 знака след запетаята.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="spentOn" type="xs:date">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Дата на разхода; не може да е в бъдещето.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="UpdateExpenseRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        PUT /api/v1/budget/expenses/{id} — policy „CanManageBudget“. Отчетната година
        се преизчислява от новата дата.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="id" type="Guid">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Идентификатор на разхода.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="description" type="ExpenseDescription">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Описание, 1–300 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="amountEur" type="AmountEur">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Сума в евро, &gt; 0.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="spentOn" type="xs:date">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Дата на разхода; не може да е в бъдещето.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="DeleteExpenseRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        DELETE /api/v1/budget/expenses/{id} — policy „CanManageBudget“.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:element name="getBudgetSummaryRequest" type="GetBudgetSummaryRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="getExpensesRequest" type="GetExpensesRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="createExpenseRequest" type="CreateExpenseRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="updateExpenseRequest" type="UpdateExpenseRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="deleteExpenseRequest" type="DeleteExpenseRequest"/>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 12. ИЗВЕСТИЯ — /api/v1/notifications                                 -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:complexType name="GetNotificationsRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        GET /api/v1/notifications — известията на текущия потребител, най-новите
        първи.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="unreadOnly" type="xs:boolean" minOccurs="0" default="false">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Само непрочетените; по подразбиране false.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="page" type="PageNumber" minOccurs="0" default="1">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Страница; по подразбиране 1.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="pageSize" type="PageSize" minOccurs="0" default="20">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(query) Размер на страницата; по подразбиране 20, максимум 100.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="MarkNotificationReadRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/notifications/{id}/read — без тяло. Връща 404, ако известието не
        принадлежи на текущия потребител.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="IdRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="MarkAllNotificationsReadRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/notifications/read-all — без параметри и без тяло.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexContent>
      <xs:extension base="EmptyRequest"/>
    </xs:complexContent>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:element name="getNotificationsRequest" type="GetNotificationsRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="markNotificationReadRequest" type="MarkNotificationReadRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="markAllNotificationsReadRequest" type="MarkAllNotificationsReadRequest"/>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 13. УСТРОЙСТВА ЗА PUSH — /api/v1/devices                             -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:complexType name="RegisterDeviceRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        POST /api/v1/devices — регистрира или опреснява push токена на текущия
        потребител. Операцията е upsert по токена: 201 при нов запис, 200 при
        опреснен съществуващ.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="token" type="DeviceToken">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Push токен, 1–512 символа.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="platform" type="DevicePlatform">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(body) Платформа на устройството.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:complexType name="DeregisterDeviceRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        DELETE /api/v1/devices/{token} — идемпотентно; премахва се само токен,
        принадлежащ на текущия потребител.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:sequence>
      <xs:element name="token" type="DeviceToken">
        <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">(path) Push токенът за премахване.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:sequence>
  </xs:complexType>

  <xs:element name="registerDeviceRequest" type="RegisterDeviceRequest"/>
  <xs:element name="deregisterDeviceRequest" type="DeregisterDeviceRequest"/>

  <!-- ==================================================================== -->
  <!-- 14. КОРЕНОВ ЕЛЕМЕНТ — коя да е заявка към API-то                     -->
  <!-- ==================================================================== -->

  <xs:element name="apiRequest">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="bg">
        Обвивка, която приема точно една произволна заявка от API-то. Полезна за
        валидиране на генерирани примери или тестови набори — самото API не приема
        този елемент.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:complexType>
      <xs:choice>
        <xs:element ref="loginRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="refreshRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="logoutRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="changePasswordRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="forgotPasswordRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="resetPasswordRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getMeRequest"/>

        <xs:element ref="getMembersRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getMyProfileRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="updateMyProfileRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="updateMyPhotoRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getMemberPhotoRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getMemberRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="createMemberRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="updateMemberRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="deactivateMemberRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="reactivateMemberRequest"/>

        <xs:element ref="getDepartmentsRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getDepartmentRequest"/>

        <xs:element ref="getTasksRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getMyTasksRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getTaskBoardRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getTaskRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="createTaskRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="updateTaskRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="changeTaskStatusRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="cancelTaskRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="deleteTaskRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getTaskCommentsRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="addTaskCommentRequest"/>

        <xs:element ref="getTaskDocumentsRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="uploadTaskDocumentRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="downloadTaskDocumentRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="deleteTaskDocumentRequest"/>

        <xs:element ref="getEventsRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="exportEventsIcsRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getEventRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="createEventRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="updateEventRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="deleteEventRequest"/>

        <xs:element ref="getDutyRecordsRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getDutySummaryRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getMyDutySummaryRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="createDutyRecordRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="updateDutyRecordRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="deleteDutyRecordRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="remindDutiesRequest"/>

        <xs:element ref="getBudgetSummaryRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="getExpensesRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="createExpenseRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="updateExpenseRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="deleteExpenseRequest"/>

        <xs:element ref="getNotificationsRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="markNotificationReadRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="markAllNotificationsReadRequest"/>

        <xs:element ref="registerDeviceRequest"/>
        <xs:element ref="deregisterDeviceRequest"/>
      </xs:choice>
    </xs:complexType>
  </xs:element>

</xs:schema>
